flowchart TD
  User[Authenticated user] --> Middleware[middleware.ts]
  Middleware --> Route[Route handler]
  Route --> Role[Role check]
  Role --> Scope[schoolId / teacher scope / guardian link / MOE guard]
  Scope --> Query[Prisma query with tenant filters]
  Query --> Response[Scoped response only]
  Scope --> Cache[tenantId:role:queryHash cache key]
  Cache --> Response
